天啊  这种事情真能让人更理智看问题
Boy, stuff like this really puts things in perspective.

347
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:17,510
你为什么穿成这样子
Why are you dressed like that?

348
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:20,130
霍华德骗我这是个换装派对
Oh, uh, Howard thought it'd be funny

349
00:15:20,130 --> 00:15:22,270
他觉得看我出糗很有意思
to tell me it was a costume party.

350
00:15:22,270 --> 00:15:23,320
这太坏了吧
That wasn't nice.

351
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:27,060
不过他差点死了  我们扯平了
No, but he almost died, so we're cool.

352
00:15:28,650 --> 00:15:31,980
仔细想一想  其实今晚就像
You know, if you think about it, tonight was kind of like

353
00:15:31,980 --> 00:15:34,390
现实版的《权力的游戏》
a real-life Game of Thrones.

354
00:15:34,390 --> 00:15:35,310
怎么会
How?

355
00:15:35,310 --> 00:15:37,430
霍华德吃下开心果
Well, Howard eating that pistachio

356
00:15:37,430 --> 00:15:39,440
就像乔佛里被毒死那幕
was like when King Joffrey got poisoned.

357
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:42,150
可那是谋杀  这是意外
Okay, well, that was murder, this was an accident.

358
00:15:42,150 --> 00:15:43,620
好的
Okay.

359
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:46,970
可你利用谢尔顿去干那些肮脏勾当
But you using Sheldon to do your dirty work

360
00:15:46,970 --> 00:15:50,200
正像瑟后利用御林铁卫执行她的命令一样
is like when Cersei used the King's Guard to do her bidding.

361
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:53,390
瑟后是靠卖肉操控男人
Cersei uses her body to manipulate men.

362
00:15:53,390 --> 00:15:56,180
佩妮只是带我去了乐高店
Penny just takes me to The LEGO store.

363
00:15:57,670 --> 00:15:59,680
好的  那这个呢
Okay. Oh, how about this?

364
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:02,280
斯图尔特穿得像个守夜人的兄弟
Stuart's dressed like a brother of the Night's Watch,

365
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:04,040
而他们没女人睡
and they don't have sex.

366
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:04,890
-说得好  -没有错
- There you go. - That's true.

367
00:16:04,890 --> 00:16:06,800
没瑕疵
Fair enough.

368
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:12,210
-你没事吧  -没事
- You all right? - I'm fine.

369
00:16:12,210 --> 00:16:15,050
就是觉得被人像抱婴儿一样抱下楼
Just a little embarrassed I had to be carried down the stairs

370
00:16:15,050 --> 00:16:16,720
有点丢人
like a baby.

371
00:16:17,030 --> 00:16:17,780
谢了
Thanks.

372
00:16:20,190 --> 00:16:21,630
我们走吧
Let's get out of here.

373
00:16:21,630 --> 00:16:22,910
太吓人了
That was scary.

374
00:16:22,910 --> 00:16:24,280
重点是
Well, the important thing is

375
00:16:24,280 --> 00:16:26,290
我说过那个三明治会毁了一切的
I said that big sandwich would ruin everything,

376
00:16:26,290 --> 00:16:27,970
被我言中了吧
and I was right.

377
00:16:31,930 --> 00:16:33,910
琼恩·雪诺
Hey, Jon Snow!

378
00:16:33,910 --> 00:16:37,850
你的马上怎么还有个篮子
How come your horse has a basket on it?

379
00:16:39,730 --> 00:16:43,120
你的脑袋上怎么还有张脸
How come your head has your face on it?

380
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:47,060
《权力的游戏》里可不会戴自行车头盔
They don't wear bicycle helmets in Game of Thrones.

381
00:16:47,060 --> 00:16:49,220
虽然你装扮有瑕疵
You're thematically inaccurate,

382
00:16:49,220 --> 00:16:52,780
但我为你的安全意识点赞
but I applaud your commitment to safety.

383
00:16:53,850 --> 00:16:56,260
你们就没别的正经事可干了吗
Don't you guys have anything better to do?

384
00:16:56,260 --> 00:16:58,230
比看一个穿皮草斗篷的人
Better than watching a guy in a fur cloak

385
00:16:58,230 --> 00:17:00,620
骑妇女车还重要的事吗  没有
ride a girl's bike? Nope.

386
00:17:02,030 --> 00:17:03,260
够了
That's it,

387
00:17:03,260 --> 00:17:06,940
你们刚刚失去了漫画店里的厕所特权
you just lost bathroom privileges at the comic book store.

388
00:17:13,710 --> 00:17:15,870
有篮子的马  一群傻子
Horse has a basket on it. Stupid...

389
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,020
莱纳德
Leonard.

390
00:17:27,570 --> 00:17:30,280
莱纳德  莱纳德
Leonard. Leonard.

391
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:31,670
干嘛
What?

392
00:17:31,670 --> 00:17:35,260
我还一直没机会问你那个蝙蝠人的问题
I never got to ask my question about Batman.

393
00:17:37,430 --> 00:17:38,640
什么问题
What is it?

394
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:42,750
如果蝙蝠人被一个放射性的人蝠咬了后
If Batman were bitten by a radioactive Man-Bat,

395
00:17:42,750 --> 00:17:46,110
然后穿成人蝠的样子去打击犯罪
and then fought crime disguised as Man-Bat,

396
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:49,170
那他是人蝠人蝠人吗
would he be Man-Bat-Man-Bat-Man

397
00:17:49,170 --> 00:17:53,360
还是人蝠人蝠蝙蝠人
or simply Man-Bat-Man-Bat-Batman?

398
00:17:55,090 --> 00:17:59,760
他在人蝠装的底下还穿着蝙蝠人装吗
Is he still wearing the Batman suit under the Man-Bat suit?

399
00:18:02,230 --> 00:18:04,340
容我思考一下再回来
I'll be back.

